a#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E254\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#upperIceWaterline> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceRequirementId> \\\"I2-003\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E255\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#upperIceWaterline> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceRequirementId> \\\"TRF-014\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E256\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#upperIceWaterlineBreadth> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityValue> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E257\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#hasUpperIceWaterline> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E258\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#fishingVessel> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> \\\"fishing_vessel\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E259\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#waterlineCaseDisplacement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E260\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#upperIceWaterline> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> \\\"true\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E261\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#fishingVessel> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E262\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#upperIceWaterlineLength> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#module> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#moduleHull> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E263\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#hasLowerIceWaterline> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> \\\"NORMALIZED (Batch 01 development): Has lower ice waterline is the benchmark representation of the linked requirement operand, relationship, evidence role, or controlled value. Exact scope is limited to the cited requirements.\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E264\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#lowerIceWaterline> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> \\\"LIWL\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E265\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#upperIceWaterlineLength> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#namingRule> \\\"N4 - preserve the source concept; normalize spelling to ASCII lowerCamelCase\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E266\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#upperIceWaterlineDraughtDUI> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#draftConceptId> \\\"VOC-DEV-R9-0334\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E267\", \"kind\": \"SCHEMA_TEXT\", \"text\": \"{\\\"datatype\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"iri\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#cargoShip\\\", \\\"kind\\\": \\\"Class\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"Cargo ship\\\", \\\"localName\\\": \\\"cargoShip\\\", \\\"parentOrRange\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#ship\\\", \\\"sourceRefs\\\": \\\"IMO26-002 | IMO_AMEND_2026 p.2 | Chapter 9-1 applicability; IMO26-016 | IMO_AMEND_2026 p.5 | Chapter 11-1 applicability\\\", \\\"unitIri\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"unitSymbol\\\": \\\"\\\"}\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"schema_terms\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E268\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#minimumRequiredPowerAtUpperIceWaterline> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceAlias> \\\"P_min_UIWL_kW\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E269\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#shipDisplacementFactor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> \\\"NORMALIZED (R9 development): Ship displacement factor represents the linked requirement entity, relationship, value, evidence role, or quantity; its scope is limited to the cited requirements.\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E270\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#upperIceWaterlineLength> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceReference> \\\"IMO-038 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.19 | 4.3.2.2\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E271\", \"kind\": \"SCHEMA_TEXT\", \"text\": \"{\\\"datatype\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"iri\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#upperIceWaterlineCase\\\", \\\"kind\\\": \\\"Class\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"Upper ice waterline case\\\", \\\"localName\\\": \\\"upperIceWaterlineCase\\\", \\\"parentOrRange\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#designCondition\\\", \\\"sourceRefs\\\": \\\"I2-004 | IACS_UR_I2 p.1 | I2.1.2.2\\\", \\\"unitIri\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"unitSymbol\\\": \\\"\\\"}\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"schema_terms\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E272\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#situatedAboveLowerIceWaterline> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#namingRule> \\\"N4 - explicit regulatory concept in ASCII lowerCamelCase with an XSD datatype.\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E273\", \"kind\": \"SCHEMA_TEXT\", \"text\": \"{\\\"datatype\\\": \\\"xsd:boolean\\\", \\\"iri\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#usedToReachLowerIceWaterline\\\", \\\"kind\\\": \\\"DatatypeProperty\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"Used to reach lower ice waterline\\\", \\\"localName\\\": \\\"usedToReachLowerIceWaterline\\\", \\\"parentOrRange\\\": \\\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean\\\", \\\"sourceRefs\\\": \\\"TRF-016 | TRAFICOM p.7 | 2.2\\\", \\\"unitIri\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"unitSymbol\\\": \\\"\\\"}\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"schema_terms\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E274\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#minimumRequiredPowerAtUpperIceWaterline> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#quantityKindLabel> \\\"Power\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E275\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#upperIceWaterline> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceRequirementId> \\\"TRF-061\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E276\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#minimumRequiredPowerAtUpperIceWaterline> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#recommendedUnit> <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloW> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E277\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#minimumRequiredPowerAtLowerIceWaterline> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> \\\"P_min_LIWL_kW\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E278\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#upperIceWaterline> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E279\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#hasUpperIceWaterline> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#namingBasis> \\\"Applicable TRAFICOM regulation wording plus explicit engineering node/operand role\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E280\", \"kind\": \"SCHEMA_TEXT\", \"text\": \"{\\\"datatype\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"iri\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#upperIceWaterlineLengthLUI\\\", \\\"kind\\\": \\\"QuantityProperty\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"Upper ice waterline length l u i\\\", \\\"localName\\\": \\\"upperIceWaterlineLengthLUI\\\", \\\"parentOrRange\\\": \\\"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityValue\\\", \\\"sourceRefs\\\": \\\"I2-015 | IACS_UR_I2 p.5 | I2.3.2.1; I2-051 | IACS_UR_I2 p.19 | I2.13.3.1; I2-054 | IACS_UR_I2 p.20 | I2.13.4.1\\\", \\\"unitIri\\\": \\\"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/M\\\", \\\"unitSymbol\\\": \\\"m\\\"}\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"schema_terms\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E281\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#hasLowerIceWaterline> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#namingRule> \\\"N5 - ASCII lowerCamelCase relationship; use has + object role when it improves direction clarity.\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E282\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#minimumRequiredPowerAtUpperIceWaterline> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityValue> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E283\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#upperIceWaterline> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#draftConceptId> \\\"VOC-0783\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E284\", \"kind\": \"SCHEMA_TEXT\", \"text\": \"{\\\"datatype\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"iri\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#minimumRequiredPowerAtLowerIceWaterline\\\", \\\"kind\\\": \\\"QuantityProperty\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"Minimum required power at lower ice waterline\\\", \\\"localName\\\": \\\"minimumRequiredPowerAtLowerIceWaterline\\\", \\\"parentOrRange\\\": \\\"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityValue\\\", \\\"sourceRefs\\\": \\\"TRF-020 | TRAFICOM p.8-9 | 3.2.2\\\", \\\"unitIri\\\": \\\"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloW\\\", \\\"unitSymbol\\\": \\\"kW\\\"}\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"schema_terms\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E285\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#fishingVessel> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#evidenceExcerpt> \\\"This chapter applies to: fishing vessels of 24 metres in length overall and above; pleasure yachts of 300 gross tonnage and upwards not engaged in trade; and cargo ships of 300 gross tonnage and upwards but below 500 gross tonnage.\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E286\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#lowerIceWaterline> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#benchmarkEntity> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E287\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#brashIceChannelResistanceAtUpperIceWaterline> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> \\\"Brash ice channel resistance at upper ice waterline\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E288\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#oilTanker> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#unitDecisionStatus> \\\"Not a quantity property\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E289\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#upperIceWaterline> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceRequirementId> \\\"I2-004\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E290\", \"kind\": \"SCHEMA_TEXT\", \"text\": \"{\\\"datatype\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"iri\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#framingIceStrengtheningAboveUpperIceWaterline\\\", \\\"kind\\\": \\\"QuantityProperty\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"Framing ice strengthening above upper ice waterline\\\", \\\"localName\\\": \\\"framingIceStrengtheningAboveUpperIceWaterline\\\", \\\"parentOrRange\\\": \\\"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityValue\\\", \\\"sourceRefs\\\": \\\"TRF-043 | TRAFICOM p.18 | 4.4.1\\\", \\\"unitIri\\\": \\\"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/M\\\", \\\"unitSymbol\\\": \\\"m\\\"}\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"schema_terms\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E291\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#upperIceWaterline> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> \\\"UIWL\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E292\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#framingIceStrengtheningAboveUpperIceWaterline> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#roleDecisionBasis> \\\"Numeric operand, comparison value, formula input/output, or engineering measurement.\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"o